@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Dashcam Cloud Service - Current System Flow (Slice 4D)

' ============================================================================
' Actors and Components
' ============================================================================

actor "Dashcam Device\n(Browser)" as Client
actor "Validator Portal\n(Angular UI)" <<REAL>> as Portal

component "Capture Client\n(TypeScript)" as CaptureApp {
  component "Sampler" as Sampler
  component "HashQueue" as Queue
  component "Uploader" as Uploader
  component "SupabaseApi" as ClientApi
}

component "Validator API\n(.NET/C#)" as ValidatorApp {
  component "ClaimsController" as Controller
  component "VerificationService" as Verify
  component "ISupabaseHashStore\n(SupabaseHashStore)" <<REAL>> as Store
  component "IVideoFrameExtractor\n(FfmpegVideoFrameExtractor)" <<REAL>> as Extractor
  component "HashMatcher" as Matcher
}

component "ffmpeg CLI" <<REAL>> as Ffmpeg
component "ImageSharp\n(PNG->RGBA)" <<REAL>> as ImageSharp

database "Supabase PostgreSQL" as DB {
  component "capture_sessions\n+ RLS policies" <<REAL>> as SessionsTable
  component "frame_hashes\n+ RLS policies" <<REAL>> as HashesTable
  component "cleanup_expired_sessions()\nRetention Function" <<REAL>> as Cleanup
}

' ============================================================================
' Capture Flow (Write Path)
' ============================================================================

Client --> Sampler : Video frames
Sampler --> Queue : enqueue(FrameHashRecord)
Queue --> Uploader : getOldestPending()
Uploader --> ClientApi : insertSession()\ninsertFrameHashes()
ClientApi --> SessionsTable : POST /rest/v1/capture_sessions\n(anon key, RLS allows INSERT)
ClientApi --> HashesTable : POST /rest/v1/frame_hashes\n(anon key, RLS allows INSERT)

note right of ClientApi
Capture Client uses anon key
RLS allows INSERT only
Cannot SELECT other users' data
end note

' ============================================================================
' Verification Flow (Read Path)
' ============================================================================

Portal --> Controller : POST /api/claims/verify\n(multipart: Video, Metadata)
Controller --> Verify : VerifyAsync(videoStream, metadata)
Verify --> Store : GetSessionAsync(sessionId)
Store --> SessionsTable : GET /rest/v1/capture_sessions?session_id=eq.{id}\n(service_role key, bypasses RLS)
Verify --> Store : GetFrameHashesAsync(sessionId)
Store --> HashesTable : GET /rest/v1/frame_hashes?session_id=eq.{id}\n&order=elapsed_ms.asc\n(service_role key, bypasses RLS)
Verify --> Extractor : ExtractFramesAsync(videoStream, intervalMs)
Extractor --> Ffmpeg : decode + fps + showinfo\n(single run)
Extractor --> ImageSharp : decode PNG frames
Verify --> Matcher : Match(reference, candidates, intervalMs)
Matcher --> Verify : matched + stats
Verify --> Controller : VerificationResult
Controller --> Portal : 200 OK + result

note right of Store
Slice 4A: SupabaseHashStore REAL
Uses PostgREST HTTP client
service_role key = full access
end note

note right of Extractor
Slice 4C: ffmpeg extraction REAL
Single-run + showinfo pts_time
end note

note right of Portal
Slice 4D: Portal wiring REAL
end note

' ============================================================================
' Retention Flow (Cleanup)
' ============================================================================

note left of Cleanup
Manual or scheduled trigger:
SELECT cleanup_expired_sessions(24);

Deletes sessions WHERE
created_at < NOW() - 24 hours

Cascades to frame_hashes
end note

' ============================================================================
' Legend
' ============================================================================

legend right
  |= Component |= Status |= Slice |
  | Capture Client (TS) | <<REAL>> | 1-3 |
  | SupabaseHashStore | <<REAL>> | 4A |
  | Supabase Schema/RLS | <<REAL>> | 4B |
  | Retention Cleanup | <<REAL>> | 4B |
  | IVideoFrameExtractor | <<REAL>> | 4C |
  | Validator Portal UI | <<REAL>> | 4D |
endlegend

@enduml

